<title>USA: Citicorp Capital sets 30-year capital securities.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Capital sets 30-year capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Citicorp Capital II was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Citicorp Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CITICORP CAPITAL II</p>
<p>AMT $450 MLN	 COUPON 8.015	MATURITY 2/15/27</p>
<p>TYPE CAPITAL SECS  ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD  8.015	PAY FREQ</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 107 BPS    CALLABLE 10</p>
<p>(( --U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
